  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - MARITIME OPERATIONS AND SAFETY, through I.M. Systems Group, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $258,000 Reverse Trade Mission (RTM) familiarizes delegates from China&apos;s Ministry of Transportation, Maritime Safety Administration and other regional transportation bureaus with U.S. practices and technologies in the areas of maritime transportation operations, safety and environmental protection. The RTM will help China&apos;s government to increase the safety and efficiency of ports, inland waterways and maritime transportation networks and better respond to environmental incidents and maritime emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
